      "reason": "The model never articulated the claimed mechanism (that commission is applied before payment causing wins above available coins). The play transcript shows normal payments and commissions to the auction winner (winner paid bids and then received a three-coin commission), with no instance or explanation of a bid exceeding coins being resolved via commission-first ordering."
